    "text": "By Gephardt Daily Staff ,\n1 days ago KEARNS, Utah, Nov. 26, 2025 (Gephardt Daily) — Two people were wounded in a shooting early Wednesday in Kearns, and the shooter remains at large. Unified Police responded about 1:24 a.m. to a report of a shooting near 5500 W. Nautilus Drive, according to Amyee Race, Unified Police public information officer. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
